iler":false,"text":"村越が復讐を始めたころに転校してきて、ひょんなきっかけから、彼と仲良くなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セミロングの髪を、普段はポニーテールにしており、スレンダーで胸は控え目な体型。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25375","sourceWorkId":"2790","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"村越が復讐を開始しようとするときに転校してきた美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀、スポーツ万能のスーパー転校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ふとしたことで村越と仲良くなってしまい、復讐の障害となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セミロングで、普段はポニーテールにしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スレンダーで貧乳。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12611"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d92f350eaf34dde56b40d44530905832c7037b6fafc72f446a3b2db50f379355.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b14049e1f96fc3c86638e8563b19946dce8b7cc94ea426e0bc112a74ad20ed4a.webp","width":145,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:20151:12611:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c13280","characterName":"高崎 真弓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"89377","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"20151"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25376"],"vndbCharacterId":"c13280"},"originalCharacterName":"高崎 真弓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of a wealthy family, she is arrogant, selfish, and cold-hearted."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She became an English teacher on a whim."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She never shows any concern for her students and has no qualms about insulting and hitting them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is beautiful, her personality is what makes her feared."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite being a teacher, she is the one who bullies Murakoshi the most."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has long hair and large breasts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13280"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ワガママで傲慢、冷酷な財閥のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気まぐれで英語教師をしているが、生徒を思うなどということは、決してない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗で豊かな胸を持つ教師だが、率先して村越を虐めている張本人。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25376","sourceWorkId":"2790","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"財閥のお嬢様で、傲慢で我侭、そして冷酷。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気まぐれで英語教師をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒を気遣うなどということは決してなく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平気で中傷し、手をあげる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗だが、その性格で恐れられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教職にありながら、村越をもっともいじめている人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロングヘアーで、巨乳。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89377"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/426a9505deab05602d1a786650db92c958675c80b3e6c894f2710dbaa97921f4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ade4d4f391c1990302cd381ddf5bffd8da78e09a524f205f17e0f75b6675c363.webp","width":145,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青海","creatorId":"vndb:s1984","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1984","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1984","name":"青海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:10004","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30844","characterName":"村越 進太","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30844"},"originalCharacterName":"村越 進太","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","sou